		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph {"dropCap":true} -->
<p class="has-drop-cap">There is an hour, just before the weather breaks, when the light turns metallic and the leaves stop moving.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We waited it out under a corrugated overhang, sharing coffee that had gone lukewarm, watching the valley gather itself.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
