		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph {"dropCap":true} -->
<p class="has-drop-cap">Named for the mother range that faces the Pacific, this journal takes its bearings from ridgelines that hold weather, memory, and the roads between them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>To write from here is to accept that the landscape was already speaking long before we arrived with notebooks.</p>
